  "actual_body_consumer_conclusion": "No earlier independent native proof lists either owned source as a compiled dependency. The accepted menu_window_cursor_consumer harness defines both functions as explicit typed six-argument deep boundaries; its CMake includes only85,1769 and three tiny actual helpers. That boundary proof remains valid and does not claim either old LOS body correct. Generic source hash recorders need refresh.",
